  "description": "Seo-Rim is in the process of divorcing her trashy husband. On the day everything, including assets, is neatly settled, her ex-husband suddenly grabs her and begs for a fresh start. As he forcefully pushes her, insisting his affair was just a fling, Tae-Yun—the office idol and her coworker—appears, blocking them and protecting Seo-Rim. X-time goes, BenX comes? Could the young, healthy, and handsome Tae-Yun truly become Seo-Rim's new love?\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
